---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="About the Project | Danish West Indies"
	description="Learn about the research team behind the Danish West Indies digital archive. We are dedicated to the quantitative analysis of colonial history and record-keeping."
>
	<div class="about-page">
		<header class="page-header animate-fade-in">
			<h1>About the Danish West Indies Project</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Preserving the memory, history, and archival data of the Danish Caribbean.</p>
		</header>

		<!-- Team Section -->
		<section class="intro-section animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
			<div class="team-header text-center">
				<h2>Our Historical Research Team</h2>
				<p>This digital archive is a collaborative effort developed as part of our Master's thesis in Economic History at the University of Copenhagen, focused on quantitative analysis of colonial record-keeping.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="team-grid">
				<!-- Anton -->
				<a href="/team/anton" class="team-card">
					<div class="avatar-placeholder">A</div>
					<div class="team-info">
						<h3>Anton Meier Ebsen Jørgensen</h3>
						<p>Master's Student & Researcher</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Jonas -->
				<a href="/team/jonas" class="team-card">
					<div class="avatar-placeholder">J</div>
					<div class="team-info">
						<h3>Jonas Amasa Skov Nielsen</h3>
						<p>Master's Student & Researcher</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Sheng -->
				<a href="/team/sheng" class="team-card">
					<div class="avatar-placeholder">S</div>
					<div class="team-info">
						<h3>Sheng Ye Michael Chen</h3>
						<p>Master's Student & Researcher</p>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Anatomy of an Archive (Idea 1) -->
		<section class="anatomy-section animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
			<h2>Anatomy of an Archive</h2>
			<p>Hover over the document below to see how we extract humanity from colonial ledgers.</p>
			
			<div class="archive-interactive">
				<img src="/images/colonial_ledger.jpg" alt="18th Century Colonial Ledger" class="ledger-img" />
				
				<!-- Interactive Pins -->
				<div class="pin" style="top: 30%; left: 35%;">
					<span class="pin-dot"></span>
					<div class="tooltip">
						<h4>The Numbers</h4>
						<p>Colonial officials recorded individuals as sheer numbers for tax purposes, dehumanizing their existence.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="pin" style="top: 55%; left: 75%;">
					<span class="pin-dot"></span>
					<div class="tooltip">
						<h4>The Names</h4>
						<p>When names were recorded, they were often colonial names forced upon them. We aim to recover original identities where possible.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="pin" style="top: 80%; left: 45%;">
					<span class="pin-dot"></span>
					<div class="tooltip">
						<h4>The Margins</h4>
						<p>Often, the most profound stories of resistance or tragedy are found scribbled hastily in the margins of these ledgers.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Contribution Form (Idea 5) -->
		<section class="contribute-section animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
			<div class="card">
				<h2>Contribute to the Thesis</h2>
				<p>Because colonial record-keeping prioritized property over humanity, the data is often incomplete. If you have access to oral histories, or wish to help transcribe 18th-century Danish cursive, please reach out.</p>
				
				<form id="contribute-form" class="contribute-form">
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="c-name">Name</label>
						<input type="text" id="c-name" required placeholder="Your Name" />
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="c-email">Email</label>
						<input type="email" id="c-email" required placeholder="you@example.com" />
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="c-message">How can you help?</label>
						<textarea id="c-message" rows="4" required placeholder="I have family records..."></textarea>
					</div>
					<button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send Message</button>
				</form>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Institutional Authority (Idea 4) -->
		<section class="partners-section animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;">
			<div class="partners-logos">
				<div class="partner">
					<span class="partner-icon">🏛️</span>
					<span>University of Copenhagen</span>
				</div>
				<div class="partner">
					<span class="partner-icon">📜</span>
					<span>Rigsarkivet (National Archives)</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<script>
	document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
		// Audio Intro Logic (Removed from main page, moved to individual team pages)


		// Form Logic
		const form = document.getElementById('contribute-form') as HTMLFormElement;
		form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
			e.preventDefault();
			alert('Thank you for your interest! A researcher will be in touch shortly.');
			form.reset();
		});
	});
</script>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.page-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.subtitle {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	/* Intro Section */
	.intro-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	}

	.team-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.team-header h2 {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.team-header p {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.team-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--space-lg);
	}

	.team-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.15);
		padding: var(--space-xl);
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.team-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.05);
	}

	.avatar-placeholder {
		width: 100px;
		height: 100px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: #000;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
		box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
	}

	.team-info h3 {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.team-info p {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	/* Anatomy Section */
	.anatomy-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.anatomy-section h2 {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.anatomy-section > p {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.archive-interactive {
		position: relative;
		display: inline-block;
		max-width: 100%;
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.3);
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
	}

	.ledger-img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		max-height: 500px;
		object-fit: cover;
		filter: contrast(1.1) sepia(0.2);
	}

	.pin {
		position: absolute;
		width: 30px;
		height: 30px;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		cursor: pointer;
		z-index: 10;
	}

	.pin-dot {
		display: block;
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		background: var(--color-accent);
		border-radius: 50%;
		box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
		position: relative;
		margin: 5px auto;
		transition: transform 0.2s;
	}

	.pin-dot::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: -5px; left: -5px; right: -5px; bottom: -5px;
		border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
		border-radius: 50%;
		animation: pulse 2s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes pulse {
		0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
		100% { transform: scale(2); opacity: 0; }
	}

	.tooltip {
		position: absolute;
		top: 100%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(10px);
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
		padding: 1rem;
		width: 250px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		text-align: left;
		box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
	}

	.pin:hover .tooltip {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(5px);
	}

	.tooltip h4 {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
	}

	.tooltip p {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	/* Contribute Section */
	.contribute-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	}

	.card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.15);
		padding: var(--space-xl);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.card h2 {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	
	.card p {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
	}

	.contribute-form {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.form-group {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.form-group label {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
	}

	.form-group input, .form-group textarea {
		padding: 0.8rem;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.3);
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: #fff;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus {
		outline: none;
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: #000;
		border: none;
		padding: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		cursor: pointer;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		transition: background 0.3s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: #d4b88f;
	}

	/* Partners */
	.partners-section {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		padding-top: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.partners-logos {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 3rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.partner {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		filter: grayscale(100%);
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.partner:hover {
		filter: grayscale(0%);
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.partner-icon {
		font-size: 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.creator-profile {
			flex-direction: column;
			text-align: center;
		}
	}
</style>
